<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3731/36  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7518/23  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9722/32  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4497/07  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     36.15/16   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.9225/40  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1710.8/1.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.28/38  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7190/40  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.3426/76  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.6732/42  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6875/85</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$320.60/10</p>
</text>
